# ReqForge artifact fixtures are byte-for-byte copies of what ReqForge actually writes
# (#296). Their value as evidence is that they are not our idea of the format, so a
# formatter reflowing their JSON frontmatter or Markdown body would quietly turn the
# fixture into a restatement of our own assumptions — which is the one thing it must
# not be.
tests/fixtures/reqforge-subject

